{{-- The Settings window playground.

     Run it from this package:

       bun ../stx/bin/cli.ts dev examples/settings.stx

     The page is one component on purpose. A page's own client script is served
     untouched by the single-file dev server, as a plain script whose state the
     template cannot see, while a component's is compiled. So everything with
     state lives in components/SettingsDemo.stx.

     Put it beside System Settings to compare: the window is 715 points wide
     there, and this one is drawn to the same measurements. --}}
